invalid type: string "Criminals on the (Pay)Roll?\nBlodwyn Silva, formerly the dastardliest criminal on the loose in Hispan ia, was finally arrested last night while attempting to abscond with a wheelbarrow full of garden gnomes. Due to the high-profile nature of her myriad cases, intelligence officers from all the agencies of the alphabet have ambushed you with some unconventional proposals.ÿÿÿÿÿ